TI Sustainable Fiber-Reinforced Polymer Nanocomposites: Processing-Structure-Property-Performance Relationships and Machine Learning-Driven Design
SO JOURNAL OF NATURAL FIBERS
LA English
DT Review
DE Sustainable composites; fiber-reinforced polymers; polymer nanocomposites; machine learning; structure-property relationships; (sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic); (sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic); (sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic); (sic)(sic)(sic)(sic); (sic)(sic)-(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)
ID COMPOSITES
AB Sustainable fiber-reinforced polymer (FRP) nanocomposites have emerged as an important class of lightweight, high-performance materials for advanced structural, thermal, and multifunctional applications. However, conventional trial-and-error design strategies remain inefficient due to the complex, multiscale interactions among matrix chemistry, fiber architecture, nanofiller dispersion, interfacial bonding, void evolution, and processing conditions, all of which critically govern composite performance. This review provides a comprehensive and critical synthesis of recent advances in sustainable FRP nanocomposites, with particular emphasis on elucidating the processing - structure - property - performance relationships. It systematically integrates developments in natural and hybrid fiber systems, diverse thermosetting and thermoplastic matrices, and emerging nanofillers, including nanoclay, graphene, carbon nanotubes (CNTs), and metal oxides. Quantitative performance trends are analyzed for key metrics, including tensile strength, elastic modulus, thermal stability, moisture resistance, and multifunctional attributes. A central focus is placed on the accelerating role of machine learning (ML) in composite engineering, encompassing predictive modeling, inverse design, defect detection, and process optimization. Various data-driven approaches are critically compared using performance indicators such as the coefficient of determination (R2) and prediction error, highlighting their reliability and generalizability. Finally, the review identifies persistent challenges, including limited and non-standardized datasets, model interpretability, and scalability constraints in sustainable composite manufacturing.(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(FRP)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic),(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic), (sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic),(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic).(sic)(sic), (sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic),(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic),(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic),(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic),(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)--(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)--(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic).(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic) FRP (sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic), (sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)-(sic)(sic)-(sic)(sic)-(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic).(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic),(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic), (sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)((sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic),(sic)(sic)(sic),(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(CNTs)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic))(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic).(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)--(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic),(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic),(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic),(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)--(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic).(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(ML)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic), (sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic),(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic),(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic).(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(R & sup2;)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic), (sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic), (sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic).(sic)(sic), (sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic), (sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic),(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic), (sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic)(sic).
